{
  "name": "Reply to inbound form leads in 60 seconds with Twilio and Google Sheets",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -470,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 520,
        "height": 820,
        "content": "## Speed-to-Lead Responder (n8n + Twilio)\n\n**Who it's for:** You get leads through your website, but by the time someone replies the lead has already moved on.\n\n**What it does:** As soon as someone submits the form, it texts them from your business number and sends the details to your rep. Your rep can call while the lead is still interested. Every lead is logged, and anyone who leaves no phone number gets an email instead.\n\n**How it works:**\n1. An n8n Form captures the lead (host it or embed the link on your site).\n2. The Config node holds your business name, rep phone, sending number, and reply text.\n3. An IF node checks whether the lead left a phone number.\n4. Twilio texts the lead, then sends your rep the name, number, and request.\n5. If there is no phone number, Gmail sends the reply instead.\n6. Google Sheets logs every lead and the time they came in.\n\n**How to use:**\n- Connect Twilio, Gmail and Google Sheets.\n- Replace the Sheet ID and put your rep's mobile in Config.\n- Set the from number to a Twilio number you own.\n- Rewrite the reply in your own voice, test the form once, then turn it on."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        50,
        260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 690,
        "height": 340,
        "content": "### Setup\nPut your rep's mobile, your Twilio number and your business name in **Config (edit me)**. Replace the Sheet ID, then connect Twilio, Gmail and Sheets."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        770,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 230,
        "height": 600,
        "content": "### 1. Reply while they're still interested\nThe lead gets a text from your business number within seconds. No phone number? The text is skipped."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1010,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 490,
        "height": 460,
        "content": "### 2. Alert the rep and log the lead\nYour rep gets the name, number and request by text. Every lead is added to the sheet, whether the first reply went by text or email."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "name": "Lead Form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "position": [
        80,
        480
      ],
      "webhookId": "speed-to-lead-form",
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "formTitle": "Get in touch",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Name",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldType": "email",
              "fieldLabel": "Email",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Phone"
            },
            {
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "fieldLabel": "What do you need help with?",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "formDescription": "Tell us what you need and we'll get back to you today."
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.5
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "name": "Config (edit me)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        300,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "business_name",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your Business"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "from_number",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "+1234567890"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "rep_number",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "+1234567890"
            },
            {
              "id": "a4",
              "name": "reply_text",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Thanks for contacting {{business}}. I've got your message and will call you shortly. If now is a bad time, just reply with a better one."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "n3",
      "name": "Has a Phone Number?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        540,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 1,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Lead Form').item.json.Phone }}",
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.3
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "name": "Text the Lead Back",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.twilio",
      "position": [
        800,
        360
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "to": "={{ $('Lead Form').item.json.Phone }}",
        "from": "={{ $('Config (edit me)').item.json.from_number }}",
        "message": "={{ $('Config (edit me)').item.json.reply_text.replace('{{business}}', $('Config (edit me)').item.json.business_name) }}",
        "options": {},
        "resource": "sms",
        "operation": "send",
        "toWhatsapp": false
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "name": "Alert the Rep by SMS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.twilio",
      "position": [
        1040,
        360
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "to": "={{ $('Config (edit me)').item.json.rep_number }}",
        "from": "={{ $('Config (edit me)').item.json.from_number }}",
        "message": "=New lead: {{ $('Lead Form').item.json.Name }}\nPhone: {{ $('Lead Form').item.json.Phone }}\nAsked about: {{ $('Lead Form').item.json['What do you need help with?'] }}\nGive them a call now.",
        "options": {},
        "resource": "sms",
        "operation": "send",
        "toWhatsapp": false
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "n6",
      "name": "Email the Lead Back",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "position": [
        800,
        620
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Lead Form').item.json.Email }}",
        "message": "=Hi {{ $('Lead Form').item.json.Name }},\n\nThanks for reaching out. I've got your message and will get back to you today.\n\nIf you'd rather talk it through, reply with a phone number and a good time to call.\n\nSpeak soon.",
        "options": {},
        "subject": "=Thanks for getting in touch with {{ $('Config (edit me)').item.json.business_name }}",
        "emailType": "text"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "n7",
      "name": "Log the Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "position": [
        1300,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "columns": {
          "value": {
            "name": "={{ $('Lead Form').item.json.Name }}",
            "email": "={{ $('Lead Form').item.json.Email }}",
            "phone": "={{ $('Lead Form').item.json.Phone }}",
            "request": "={{ $('Lead Form').item.json['What do you need help with?'] }}",
            "first_touch": "={{ $('Lead Form').item.json.Phone ? 'SMS' : 'Email' }}",
            "received_at": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
          },
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow"
        },
        "options": {},
        "operation": "append",
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "Leads",
          "cachedResultName": "Leads"
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.7
    }
  ],
  "active": false,
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "connections": {
    "Lead Form": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Config (edit me)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Config (edit me)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Has a Phone Number?",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Text the Lead Back": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Alert the Rep by SMS",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Email the Lead Back": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Log the Lead",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Has a Phone Number?": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Text the Lead Back",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Email the Lead Back",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Alert the Rep by SMS": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Log the Lead",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
